				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παππικός, βίος</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				1452
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄνομα</span>”
